 "_about": "Danh muc may sinh giong (giao dien I3). Khoa bat dau bang '_' la ghi chu. role: train = dung sinh du lieu hoc; heldout = CHI dung cho tap thu (may la). family: cung ho thi khong dung mot ben train mot ben heldout. needs_vc: giong co san, muon nhai nguoi trong kho thi noi tiep may VC. smoke: ket qua thu nhanh do v6/tts_multi/engines/smoke.py ghi. Chay: <env_python> -m v6.tts_multi.run_engine --engine <ten> --jobs <jobs.jsonl> --out <dir> (PYTHONPATH xem v6.tts_multi.command). Truoc khi nap, run_engine kiem commit RAM: can = smoke.peak_commit_mb (hoac min_commit_mb) +10 % +256 MB; may con it hon -> khong nap, ma thoat 3 (tranh no pagefile tren C:); --allow-pagefile-growth de bo kiem; muc can tinh san: v6.tts_multi.commit_required_mb(ten). smoke.code_rev = phien ban adapter luc smoke (thieu = '1'); adapter da doi (Engine.code_rev khac) -> run_engine KHONG nap, ma thoat 1 'smoke cu' cho toi khi smoke lai (--allow-stale-smoke de bo qua).",
